
# Lab 03 — Group Policy Inspection

## Objective
Inspect Windows password policy settings using Local Group Policy Editor.

## Environment
- OS: Windows 11 Pro
- Account: BUTLERLAB\Administrator
- Tool: Local Group Policy Editor (gpedit.msc)

## Procedure
1. Opened Local Group Policy Editor.
2. Navigated to Computer Configuration.
3. Opened Windows Settings > Security Settings.
4. Navigated to Account Policies > Password Policy.
5. Inspected password security settings.

## Findings
- Minimum password length: 10 characters.
- Password complexity: Enabled.
- Maximum password age: 90 days.

## Skills Practiced
- Group Policy inspection.
- Password policy configuration review.
- Windows security administration.

## Result
Successfully inspected local Windows password policy settings.
